WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.286 --> 00:00:10.213
The hermit stood over Edward, holding the knife. "At last! Retribution! Sweet revenge!" he shouted.

2
00:00:10.214 --> 00:00:14.774
Edward was wide awake now and trembling at the sight before him. The hermit had

3
00:00:14.775 --> 00:00:19.854
tied his feet and his hands together, and he could barely move. Tears trickled down

4
00:00:19.855 --> 00:00:25.019
the poor boy's cheeks, and he let out a frightened whimper. "I hope you have

5
00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:30.506
prayed, son of Henry VIII!" cried the hermit. Just then there was a loud

6
00:00:30.507 --> 00:00:40.091
"Hello!" from outside the cabin. Edward held his breath as thunderous knocks struck the door.

7
00:00:40.092 --> 00:00:47.686
The hermit cursed under his breath. Then he tossed several heavy sheepskin blankets over Edward

8
00:00:47.687 --> 00:00:51.908
and went to the door. "I have come for the boy!" a familiar voice announced.

9
00:00:51.909 --> 00:00:54.931
It was Miles Hendon! For a moment, Edward was ecstatic. He tried to shout, to

10
00:00:54.932 --> 00:01:05.251
tell Miles that he was there. But the heavy blankets muffled the sound of his

11
00:01:05.252 --> 00:01:11.074
voice. Edward's spirits sank. "Miles will never know I am here," he realized. The hermit

12
00:01:11.075 --> 00:01:18.321
was still talking to Miles. "I live alone, humbly and simply, sir." "Do not lie

13
00:01:18.322 --> 00:01:25.892
to me!" Miles roared. "I have tracked him here!" He tried to push his way

14
00:01:25.893 --> 00:01:30.222
past the hermit. But the old man blocked him; he was much stronger than

15
00:01:30.223 --> 00:01:35.465
he looked. The hermit described Edward's appearance. "Is that the boy you seek?" "Yes. Now

16
00:01:35.466 --> 00:01:39.477
where is he?" Miles demanded. "Right here!" Edward screamed inside. "He passed by my cabin,

17
00:01:39.478 --> 00:01:43.538
and I saw him heading in that direction." The hermit pointed off to the distance.

18
00:01:43.539 --> 00:01:53.452
"Let me show you." The hermit led Miles outside, and soon their voices faded away.

19
00:01:53.453 --> 00:01:58.443
Tears filled Edward's eyes again. "What will be my fate now?" he wondered. Just then

20
