00:02:19.188 --> 00:02:24.248
his wrists and ankles. Edward was so relieved it wasn't the hermit, he nearly thanked

24
00:02:24.249 --> 00:02:28.928
them. "Let's get him out of here before that crazy hermit returns," Canty said. Each

25
00:02:28.929 --> 00:02:34.258
man took one of Edward's arms, and together they pulled him into the open air

26
00:02:34.259 --> 00:02:41.734
and through the dark woods. When they reached the vagrants' camp, Canty dropped Edward at

