have many witnesses," replied the guard. "I demand that you release him!" Miles said.

49
00:05:09.890 --> 00:05:17.436
"We are arresting him!" declared the guard, and with that, he spun around, dragging Edward

50
00:05:17.437 --> 00:05:25.126
with him. Miles rushed after them, still trying to argue that Edward was innocent. The

51
