I do!" the woman declared. "The penalty is death," the judge reminded her. Edward gasped.

60
00:06:26.065 --> 00:06:30.466
He couldn't believe it. "Stealing is very wrong," he thought. "But surely it is not

61
00:06:30.467 --> 00:06:34.046
deserving of the penalty of death. What if the thief was merely a poor and

62
